sequenceDiagram
    Actor User
    participant UI as Client UI
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant TS as ThreadService
    participant DB as Database

    opt user first opens thread list in a session

    User->>UI: requestThreadList()
    activate UI
    UI->>API: GET /api/threads/get_all_threads
    activate API
    API->>TS: getAllThreads()
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: SELECT * FROM threads
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: {thread rows}
    deactivate DB
    TS-->>API: Thread Array
    deactivate TS
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (ThreadList)
    deactivate API
    UI-->>User: sendThreadList(threads)
    deactivate UI

    end

    User->>UI: requestThreadMessages(thread_id)
    activate UI
    UI->>API: GET /api/threads/{id}/messages
    activate API
    API->>TS: getThreadMessages(thread_id)
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: SELECT * FROM messages WHERE thread_id = thread_id
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: {message rows}
    deactivate DB
    TS-->>API: Message Array
    deactivate TS
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (MessageList)
    deactivate API

    loop for each message received
    UI-->>User: Display Message
    end

    deactivate UI
